window.products.push({"id":1043203,"name":"sofani Sofani Stitched Quilt Set King Size(106inchx96inch, White) - Super Soft Lightweight Microfiber Bedspreads & Coverlet for King Bed - 3 Pieces(In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xQr2pFojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM FINE QUALITY: Our quilted bedspreads set was made from 100% Microfiber. Compare other offers, 100GSM pre-washed brushed fabric and 130GSM filling make the quilts more soft and durable; Otherwise it brings more breathable and lightweight feeling than a regular cotton quilt and provides you an unique soft, comfortable and luxurious feeling that help you sleep better. SIZES & MEASUREMENTS: The quilt set includes one quilt( 106'' x 96''), two shams( 20'' x 36'') which would fit king size bed. Note: If you want to have the quilt hanging down to both sides of the bed or have an effect shown in the picture, we recommend that you buy a larger quilt or have it on a lower height mattress. MULTI-PURPOSE USAGE: Perfect quilt coverlet for your bedroom, guest room or vacation room. This quilt suitable for summer, spring, autumn/fall season use. In the winter, you could add a comforter or blanket underneath. It is also easy to move freely with this coverlet when you have night sweats or toss and turn a lot. EASY CARE: Machine wash separately on gentle cycle with cold water before first use - No shrinkage, No color fading and No unravelling after every washing. Caution: tumble dry at low temperature, steam if needed, DO NOT iron. WHAT YOU CAN GET: Package includes Sofani 3 pieces white king size quilt set(1 Quilt & 2 Shams). We offer 30-days return and replacement service & life-time free customer service. If you not satisfied with our products, please contact us immediately with no hesitate. Included components: Pillow Sham","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xQr2pFojL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sofani","source_asin":"B09P3Y9VCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1043203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P3Y9VCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P3Y9VCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
