window.products.push({"id":1043692,"name":"Haley Party 40th Birthday Decorations 40th Anniversary Decorations 40 Party Confetti Metallic Foil Number Confetti for 40th Birthday Party Anniversary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h-Tp9yPyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT QUALITY – Our 40 party confetti are made from foil They have nice crisp cutout and very cute looking. Thicker and heavier than tissue paper confetti, they are prefect 40th anniversary decorations. ADD SPARKLE TO THE PARTY – What’s a 40th birthday or a party without 40th birthday decorations? Mix colors pack include shinny gold, silver and black. These 40 party confetti are great 40th birthday decoration and prefect sparkling 40th anniversary decorations. PERFECT SIZE & QUANTITY – Package contains approximately 1oz 40th anniversary confetti gold, silver and black mix. Each 0.5oz individually packed. Each confetti is about 0.5” x 0.4” (1.2cm x 1cm). Prefect size and quantity for 40th anniversary decorations, filling jars and stuffing cards. SPREAD THE FUN – Scatter across table tops, fill into balloons and birthday party invitations, these 40 party confetti are so cute to spread the fun of amazing 40 years. Inexpensive and reusable, you can re-use these cute 40th birthday decoration for 40th anniversary decorations. ENJOY WITH A CAUSION – Who doesn’t like the fun these 40th anniversary confetti gold , silver and black mix bring to the party! Kids and adults both enjoy the magic of confetti, but beware of small pieces, they can present a choking hazard so please keep away from small children. These 40 party confetti are so cute kids might think they are candies, but we sure don’t want anyone eating them!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h-Tp9yPyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haley Party","source_asin":"B07HCBFRMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1043692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HCBFRMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HCBFRMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1043693,"name":"Treble Bass Clef Heart Music Black Metal Snowflake Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E2KzRIUHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Ho ho ho! Make your Christmas tree something special this year - and for years to come - with this unique metal ornament from Graphics and More. Unlike glass bulb ornaments, this decoration is not fragile, so it's perfect for families with kids or pets. Whether you're looking to commemorate a special occasion, give a gift with a personal touch, or just expand your collection of holiday pieces, this is the product for you! The product is made from a beautiful nickel plated metal with the resin-topped festive design shown. The design is single-sided, and a hand-tied cord for hanging the item is included. Ornament dimensions are 2.1\" (5.3 cm) x 2.4\" (6.1 cm). All creative internal designs apply. In other words unlicensed. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E2KzRIUHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B07FT296DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1043693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FT296DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FT296DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
