window.products.push({"id":1043878,"name":"Portmeirion Botanic Garden Oval Baking Dish | 11 Inch Baking Dish with Belladonna Lily Motif | Made from Porcelain | Oven, Dishwasher, and Microwave S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZtfFDdiL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"In 1972, Portmeirion Founder and Designer, Susan Williams-Ellis, created one of the worlds most popular dinnerware patterns, Botanic Garden. To this day this pattern continues to grow and thrive with new flowers, colors and shapes. The pattern has many rich floral motifs usually found in English gardens and are always enhanced with an Ivy border. These designs are used throughout the extensive collection of Dinnerware, Serve ware, Bake ware and Decorative items for the home. Watch your garden continue to grow with the 11.0 x 7.25\"\" Oval Baking Dish made of fine porcelain. Cook and Serve with this freezer safe, oven safe to 400 degrees, microwave safe and dishwasher safe baking dish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZtfFDdiL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B006GQUFVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1043878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006GQUFVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006GQUFVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1043879,"name":"Kitchen Pro 101- Airtight Food and Cereal Storage Containers - 5 Piece Set - BPA-Free - Durable Clear Plastic with White Easy Lock Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gt8Xm0+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen Pro 101- Airtight Food and Cereal Storage Containers - 5 Piece Set ★Turn your messy nightmare of a pantry into an organized haven! ★When was the last time I've opened your pantry and smiled? Do you dread going into your pantry because it’s a food free-for-all in there? ★Beans, pasta, sugar, spices, cereal, snacks have no rhyme or reason on the shelves – and you could swear they’d moved around since the last time you were in there? ★Are you ready to put law and order into your chaotic pantry, cabinets or counters? Practical, perfect sizes, and thoughtfully designed Kitchen Pro 101 Airight Food Storage Containers are modular, stackable, and designed to adapt to your food storage space. ★Though the heights of each container differs, the consistent width of each container makes them alignable and easy to organize. ★Our plastic BPA-Free food storage containers are attractive enough to display on your counters, but strong enough to last you for years to come. And thanks to our airtight lockable lids, your food will stay fresh longer and retain its nutrients. ★Our airtight canisters works equally well for liquids such as juice, soup, stews and sauces and because of the airtight seal; you don’t need to worry about spills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gt8Xm0+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Pro 101","source_asin":"B075GZ5138","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1043879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GZ5138","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GZ5138","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
